   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.2#p1-b36b2be3",
     "text": "That is, he proclaimed a solemn sacrifice and commanded that all should attend.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "spake unto all Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.3",
   "range": "2CH.1.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "375f0c9b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.3#p1-7e603179",
     "text": "Read 1Ki 3:4.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "Gibeon",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 3:4",
       "ref": "1KI.3.4"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.3#p2-849c390c",
     "text": "So called, because by it God showed signs of his presence to the congregation.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "of the congregation of God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.5",
   "range": "2CH.1.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "31ee5241",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.5#p1-31ee5241",
     "text": "Which was for the burnt offerings, Ex 27:1.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "brasen altar",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 27:1",
       "ref": "EXO.27.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.9",
   "range": "2CH.1.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "dde6e039",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.9#p1-dde6e039",
     "text": "Perform your promise made to my father concerning me.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "established"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.10",
   "range": "2CH.1.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e6967738",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.10#p1-e6967738",
     "text": "That I may govern this people, 1Ch 27:1, 1Ki 3:7.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "go out and come in before",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 27:1, 1Ki 3:7",
       "ref": "1CH.27.1"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 27:1, 1Ki 3:7",
       "ref": "1KI.3.7"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.11",
   "range": "2CH.1.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3eed7473",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.11#p1-3eed7473",
     "text": "That is, to be avenged on your enemies.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "life of thine enemies"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.14",
   "range": "2CH.1.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c7f36fdb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.14#p1-c7f36fdb",
     "text": "Which were cities appointed to keep and maintain the chariots.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "chariot cities"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.15",
   "range": "2CH.1.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "42b067c1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.1.15#p1-42b067c1",
     "text": "He caused so great plenty that it was valued no more than stones.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "stones"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.1.16",
   "range": "2CH.1.16",
